<DocLayout
  title="温控 Cluster · Thermostat（0x0201）"
  description="Matter Thermostat Cluster（0x0201）完整参考 — SystemMode/SetpointRaiseLower 等命令、LocalTemperature/OccupiedCoolingSetpoint 等 40+ 属性定义、枚举值速查与真实设备数据示例。"
